OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers are
OL,6,Fpossible this evening and overnight,
OL,7,Flocally fairly heavy, especially in
OL,8,Fthe west. However, many places will
OL,9,Fmiss these and stay dry throughout the
OL,10,Fnight. Remaining rather warm and humid
OL,11,Fin most areas although turning windier
OL,12,Fin coastal regions.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FDry albeit rather cloudy
OL,15,Ffor most. An increasing chance of
OL,16,Fshowers in the north and west but few
OL,17,Fif any elsewhere. A windier day and
OL,18,Ffeeling considerably cooler than
OL,19,Frecently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
